## Unicode and CLDR data (ICU4X)

`agnijs-js-intl` implements ECMA-402 (`Intl`) on ICU4X (`icu_*` crates, version 2.4). The `icu_*_data` crates compiled into the engine contain Unicode, CLDR and ICU data, and `crates/agnijs-js-intl/src/tables.rs` and `cldr_tables.rs` are generated from Unicode data and CLDR JSON (`crates/agnijs-js-intl/tools`). The regex crate's Unicode property and case-folding tables and the parser's identifier tables (`unicode-id-start`) derive from the same Unicode Character Database. That data is distributed under the Unicode License v3, reproduced here as the license requires. Crates carrying it are marked `Unicode-3.0` in their metadata; ICU4X itself is by the Unicode Consortium and contributors.

